Third-party material
--------------------

SDPO (lasgroup/SDPO), a fork of verl
  https://github.com/lasgroup/SDPO, commit 7c457fc1b1f636ae794eb0362ba37d4743b06fbc
  Apache License 2.0
  environment/Dockerfile and tests/Dockerfile clone it into /opt/SDPO. The team's files in
  environment/overlay/SDPO/ (copied to tests/__image__/overlay/SDPO/) are added on top of it. The
  freeze bundles of the recorded runs redistribute the agent's copy of /opt/SDPO: this tree, the
  overlay and the agent's changes. The reference solution replaces the overlay's
  verl/utils/reward_score/feedback/terminal.py with solution/terminal.py and adds
  solution/feedback_guard.py and solution/feedback_words.txt next to it.

